Z||000036||Patrick's Dad||05-27-2001||11:43 AM||||Chakotay: "Have you given any thought to what will happen when we reach the Alpha Quadrant?"<P>Seven: "Well, I expect that Starfleet would debrief me...."<P>Yeah, I'd like to debrief her too. Or Depanty. Or Dethong. Whatever.<P>As a fan from way back (I can empathize with Fiero5's first post, but, living just south of Boston, we had no trouble getting Channel 56.), I thought, at times, it was lightweight, and I agree that the recent formula with ST:V and ST <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">S9 was 90% buildup and 10% solution. Still, It will be great to see the Enterprise fly again, if that's what they plan to do. I imagine that Scott B. will be Capt. Robert April?||||reg||1
